From: irregularthanis <343663069+irregularthanis@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:58:17 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 220/221] Aurora: a faster effects mask, half size and one
 pass, opt-in (RecompCore #68, as merged)

RecompCore #68 as it was merged into the 0.13.0 re-cut batch (codex/0.13.0-batch-2, d733290f), in one patch: its 3 commits after #67's.

- f612af1b90 Aurora: the effects' mask at half size (opt-in)
- 62254253ad Aurora: the fast mask's half-size depth made once for both passes without own-depth effects
- 8c2434c0df Aurora: the fast effects' mask in one pass
---
